<p>{"Two bears in one — meet the "}<strong>{"Choco Cap Teddy Bear"}</strong>{". A soft white plush bear dressed in a cosy chocolate brown hoodie, complete with an embroidered bear face on the cap. This irresistible dual-look design is what makes it one of the most instantly loveable soft toys in our collection. Whether it's sitting on a shelf or being squeezed tight at bedtime, this bear always draws a smile."}</p>
